{"seq":3,"slug":"intercompany-pricing-doc-link","title":"内部定价与文档一致性（衔接146）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/beps-three-tier-doc/intercompany-pricing-doc-link","wordCount":1906,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"内部定价与文档一致性-衔接146\">内部定价与文档一致性（衔接146）</h1><p>本地文档里写的定价政策是&quot;我们按成本加 8% 向关联方销售&quot;，而内部结算系统里实际跑出来的价格是按季度调价的、并且不同产品线的加成率在 5% 到 14% 之间波动——这个不一致本身就是稽查最省力的切入点，因为它不需要任何经济分析就能成立。文档一致性不是文书工作，它是<strong>合规主张与系统行为之间的对账</strong>。这一篇从系统建设者的角度，讲清这种对账在数据模型层面需要什么约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-不一致的四种典型形态\">核心概念：不一致的四种典型形态</h2><p>一致性失败不是一个单一的失误，它至少有四种形态，各自需要不同的防范手段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[文档宣称的定价政策] --&gt; B{与系统实际行为比对}&#10;  B --&gt;|数值不符| C[第一类: 政策参数漂移&lt;br/&gt;加成率区间与文档不符]&#10;  B --&gt;|分类不符| D[第二类: 交易类型错配&lt;br/&gt;服务费实际是特许权]&#10;  B --&gt;|主体不符| E[第三类: 主体归属错位&lt;br/&gt;功能由A执行 收入记B]&#10;  B --&gt;|时点不符| F[第四类: 期间错配&lt;br/&gt;跨期调整未在文档体现]\">graph TD\n  A[文档宣称的定价政策] --&gt; B{与系统实际行为比对}\n  B --&gt;|数值不符| C[第一类: 政策参数漂移&lt;br/&gt;加成率区间与文档不符]\n  B --&gt;|分类不符| D[第二类: 交易类型错配&lt;br/&gt;服务费实际是特许权]\n  B --&gt;|主体不符| E[第三类: 主体归属错位&lt;br/&gt;功能由A执行 收入记B]\n  B --&gt;|时点不符| F[第四类: 期间错配&lt;br/&gt;跨期调整未在文档体现]</pre><p>四类里，第三类最危险。数值不符可以在文档中更新参数来修正，分类不符可以在下一年度重新定性，但<strong>主体归属错位会动摇整个 FAR 分析的基础</strong>——如果文档说德国实体执行本地营销功能，而系统的成本归集显示这些费用实际由爱尔兰主体承担，那么利润分配的依据就不成立了。这类问题往往源于集团组织架构调整后系统配置未同步更新。</p>\n<p>四类不一致的探测手段与修复成本差异显著：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>探测手段</th>\n<th>修复成本</th>\n<th>可否跨年度追溯修正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>政策参数漂移</td>\n<td>年度对账报告自动比对</td>\n<td>低：更新参数或解释波动</td>\n<td>可以，属文档性修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易类型错配</td>\n<td>受控词汇表 + 合同引用校验</td>\n<td>中：需重新定性方法</td>\n<td>可以，但影响该方法历史论证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体归属错位</td>\n<td>功能角色表与成本归集交叉核对</td>\n<td>高：动摇 FAR 与利润分配</td>\n<td>极难，通常只能向前修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期间错配</td>\n<td>跨期调整台账与文档期间比对</td>\n<td>中：需在文档中显式说明</td>\n<td>可以，前提是台账完整</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>读表时注意&quot;可否跨年度追溯修正&quot;这一列——它决定了你现在应当优先投入哪一类防范。主体归属错位是唯一几乎无法追溯修复的一类，因此它值得在功能角色表上做最严格的源头控制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定价政策的可执行表达\">定价政策的可执行表达</h2><p>一致性要求的第一件事，是让定价政策成为<strong>系统可以执行的规则</strong>，而不是一段散文。散文式政策无法被自动校验，也就无法在数据产生的时点发现偏差。</p>\n<p>可执行的表达需要三个要素：规则适用的交易范围、确定价格的算法（含参数）、以及允许的偏离窗口。以成本加成法为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;policyId&quot;: &quot;TP-CM-2026-001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;method&quot;: &quot;cost_plus&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;txnType&quot;: &quot;manufacturing_service&quot;,&#10;    &quot;sellerEntity&quot;: &quot;CN-Production-Co&quot;,&#10;    &quot;buyerEntities&quot;: [&quot;DE-Ops&quot;, &quot;SG-Hub&quot;]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;pricing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;base&quot;: &quot;total_service_cost&quot;,&#10;    &quot;excludedCosts&quot;: [&quot;abnormal_idle_capacity&quot;, &quot;interest_expense&quot;],&#10;    &quot;markup&quot;: 0.08,&#10;    &quot;toleranceBand&quot;: [0.06, 0.1]&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;reviewCycle&quot;: &quot;annual&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evidenceRef&quot;: &quot;local-file-CN-2026#section-4.2&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"policyId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TP-CM-2026-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cost_plus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"txnType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manufacturing_service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"sellerEntity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN-Production-Co\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"buyerEntities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE-Ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SG-Hub\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pricing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"total_service_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"excludedCosts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"abnormal_idle_capacity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"interest_expense\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"markup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"toleranceBand\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reviewCycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"annual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidenceRef\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local-file-CN-2026#section-4.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键字段是 <code>evidenceRef</code>——<strong>每一条定价政策都必须指回文档中的具体章节</strong>。这个反向引用是双向对账的锚点：从系统可以追溯到文档依据，从文档可以追溯到系统实现。缺了这个字段，一致性就只能靠人记忆维持。政策的允差窗又直接来源于可比性分析得到的独立交易区间，这一层论证见 <a href=\"../tax-audit-defense/comparable-defense-evidence\">可比性分析与抗辩证据</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"允差窗设计\">允差窗设计</h3><p><code>toleranceBand</code> 支持实际执行在参数附近浮动，避免每一次微小偏离都被当作违规。但允差窗的设计有一个反直觉之处：<strong>允差窗越宽，文档的合规主张越弱</strong>。因为区间端点会直接传递到独立交易区间的论证中——如果政策本身允许 6% 到 10% 的浮动，那么可比区间的下沿必须能容纳 6%。设计允差窗时应当反过来从可比区间倒推，而不是从内部管理便利出发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型层面的三项约束\">数据模型层面的三项约束</h2><h3 id=\"约束一-交易分类的受控词汇表\">约束一：交易分类的受控词汇表</h3><p>交易类型不能是自由文本。系统应当维护一份受控词汇表，与文档中的交易分类一一对应，且新增类型必须经过税务确认。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE txn_type_vocab (&#10;  code           TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  label          TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  docSection     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  methodPolicy   TEXT REFERENCES tp_pricing_policy(policy_id),&#10;  active_from    DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  active_to      DATE&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE intercompany_txn (&#10;  txn_id         TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  seller_entity  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  buyer_entity   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  txn_type       TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES txn_type_vocab(code),&#10;  amount         NUMERIC(18,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency       CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  booked_at      DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  contract_ref   TEXT,&#10;  CONSTRAINT royalty_needs_contract&#10;    CHECK (txn_type &lt;&gt; &#39;royalty&#39; OR contract_ref IS NOT NULL)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> txn_type_vocab</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  code           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  label          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  docSection     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  methodPolicy   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tp_pricing_policy(policy_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  active_from    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  active_to      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> intercompany_txn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  txn_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seller_entity  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buyer_entity   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  txn_type       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> txn_type_vocab(code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  booked_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  contract_ref   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> royalty_needs_contract</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (txn_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'royalty'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contract_ref </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>表结构里最有用的是最后那条检查约束。它把&quot;特许权使用费必须有合同引用&quot;这条文档要求，变成了数据库层面的硬约束——违反时记录根本写不进去，而不是等到文档编制时才发现。这条要求的实质依据是：转让定价的申报错误会触发罚则，而主张合理依据需要文档可追溯，含税与不含税、合同与实际执行的口径必须能相互印证（罚则与合理依据的构成见 <a href=\"../tax-audit-defense/adjustment-double-tax-relief\">纳税调整与双重征税消除</a>，规则原文见 <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/26/1.6662-6\">26 CFR § 1.6662-6</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"约束二-功能归属的单一来源\">约束二：功能归属的单一来源</h3><p>每个实体的功能角色（制造、分销、研发、品牌持有）必须有单一来源，并由系统强制执行。若同一实体在不同系统中被赋予不同的功能标签，FAR 分析的输入就不可靠。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE entity_function (&#10;  entity_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  function_code  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  is_primary     BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   DATE,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (entity_id, function_code, effective_from)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> entity_function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  function_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_primary     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entity_id, function_code, effective_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按生效区间建模而非直接覆盖，是为了能在事后回答&quot;2026 年这家实体的功能角色是什么&quot;——稽查涉及的年度往往在两三年前，功能角色在此期间很可能变过（参见 <a href=\"../apa-advance-arrangement/apa-renew-adjust\">APA 续签与经营变化调整</a> 中关于关键假设变化的处理）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"约束三-年度对账报告\">约束三：年度对账报告</h3><p>前两项约束保证数据在产生时正确，第三项保证能被验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH declared AS (&#10;  SELECT policy_id, markup AS declared_markup FROM tp_pricing_policy&#10;  WHERE active_from &lt;= &#39;2026-12-31&#39; AND (active_to IS NULL OR active_to &gt;= &#39;2026-01-01&#39;)&#10;),&#10;actual AS (&#10;  SELECT p.policy_id,&#10;         (SUM(t.amount) - SUM(c.cost_amount)) / NULLIF(SUM(c.cost_amount), 0) AS actual_markup&#10;  FROM intercompany_txn t&#10;  JOIN tp_pricing_policy p ON p.policy_id = t.policy_id&#10;  JOIN cost_pool c        ON c.txn_id = t.txn_id&#10;  WHERE t.booked_at BETWEEN &#39;2026-01-01&#39; AND &#39;2026-12-31&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY p.policy_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT d.policy_id, d.declared_markup, ROUND(a.actual_markup, 4) AS actual_markup,&#10;       CASE WHEN ABS(a.actual_markup - d.declared_markup) &gt; 0.01 THEN &#39;REVIEW&#39; ELSE &#39;OK&#39; END AS flag&#10;FROM declared d JOIN actual a USING (policy_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy_id, markup </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared_markup </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tp_pricing_policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-12-31'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (active_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> active_to </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">actual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">policy_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cost_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cost_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_markup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intercompany_txn t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tp_pricing_policy p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">policy_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">policy_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cost_pool c        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">txn_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">txn_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">booked_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-12-31'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">policy_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">policy_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_markup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_markup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_markup,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_markup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_markup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REVIEW'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'OK'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> declared d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (policy_id);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段查询应当作为年度文档编制的第一步运行。任何 <code>REVIEW</code> 标记都需要解释：是允差窗内的正常波动，还是政策参数已经过时，还是存在未按政策执行的交易。<strong>解释必须留下记录</strong>——这在稽查时是从容与被动的分界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-146-主体架构的衔接边界\">与 146 主体架构的衔接边界</h2><p>这一篇处理的是&quot;同一集团内部，文档与系统的一致性&quot;。集团顶层主体怎么搭、贸易流怎么设计，是相邻 hub 的主题；本 hub 的输入是那边已经确定的主体结构。两者衔接的方式是：主体架构决定关联交易的存在与形式，本 hub 决定这些交易如何被定价、证明与申报。当主体架构发生调整时，本这篇的一致性约束会立刻被触发——新增实体会带来新的功能角色、新的定价政策、以及新的文档章节。把架构变更作为一致性对账的触发事件，而不是年度例行，是实践中能避免大量返工的一条纪律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>文档不一致有四类形态：政策参数漂移、交易类型错配、主体归属错位、期间错配；主体归属错位会动摇 FAR 分析的基础，危害最大。</li>\n<li>定价政策必须可执行：含适用范围、算法参数、允差窗，并反向引用文档章节。</li>\n<li>允差窗应当从可比区间倒推设计，越宽的允差窗意味着越弱的合规主张。</li>\n<li>三项数据模型约束：受控交易分类词汇表、功能归属的生效区间建模、年度自动对账报告。</li>\n<li>对账产生的每一条 REVIEW 标记都必须留下解释记录，这是稽查时从容与被动的分界。</li>\n<li>主体架构变更是触发一致性对账的事件，而不是等到年度例行。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内部定价与文档一致性（衔接146）","id":"内部定价与文档一致性-衔接146"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：不一致的四种典型形态","id":"核心概念-不一致的四种典型形态"},{"level":2,"text":"定价政策的可执行表达","id":"定价政策的可执行表达"},{"level":3,"text":"允差窗设计","id":"允差窗设计"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模型层面的三项约束","id":"数据模型层面的三项约束"},{"level":3,"text":"约束一：交易分类的受控词汇表","id":"约束一-交易分类的受控词汇表"},{"level":3,"text":"约束二：功能归属的单一来源","id":"约束二-功能归属的单一来源"},{"level":3,"text":"约束三：年度对账报告","id":"约束三-年度对账报告"},{"level":2,"text":"与 146 主体架构的衔接边界","id":"与-146-主体架构的衔接边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同期资料准备与年度关联申报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/beps-three-tier-doc/contemporaneous-doc-prepare"},"next":{"title":"单边/双边 APA 申请","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/transfer-pricing-tax-audit-defense/apa-advance-arrangement/apa-apply-bilateral-unilateral"}}